[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "（それから私たちは、\n　赤のほうき星の調査を開始しました）",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "師匠、これは――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "赤く変色したマナよ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "昔、赤のほうき星が襲来した場所で見つけたの。\nもしかしたら、何か分かるかもしれない",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "あなたに渡すわ。今までの研究資料もね。\n好きに使ってちょうだい",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "はい！　ありがとうございます",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "（赤いマナは、赤のほうき星に関係がある――\n　そう考え、私は研究を始めました）",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "（これを調べれば、白きほうき星が赤く変心した原因の\n　一端を明らかにできるかもしれない――）",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "（……そう張り切ったはいいものの、\n　簡単にはいきませんでした）",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 8455227271865371244,
    "text": "レスナ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6891392099494261238,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 8455227271865371244,
    "text": "もちろん、私たちにも手伝わせてよね",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6891392099494261238,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "（でも、私は一人じゃなかった）",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "せめて、赤くなった理由が内的要因なのか\n外的要因なのかだけでも目星が付けられたら……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "localized_name": "リアス",
    "romanized_name": "Rias",
    "model_path_hash": 8538886338969864227,
    "text": "それなんだけどさ、\nクルシュアの話が参考にならないかな？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 1321279492992502345,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "localized_name": "スレイ",
    "romanized_name": "Slade",
    "model_path_hash": 1119361770767559406,
    "text": "２年前、俺たちが戦った竜のことだ。\n白竜クルシュアはある時、突如として紅くなったんだ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 5581277904703418049,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 8455227271865371244,
    "text": "突如、紅く……白きほうき星と同じね",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6891392099494261238,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "localized_name": "リアス",
    "romanized_name": "Rias",
    "model_path_hash": 8538886338969864227,
    "text": "うん。赤のほうき星が原因なんじゃないかって\nあたしたち、思ってたんだけど……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 1321279492992502345,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "赤く変心したほうき星と白竜……\n同じ原因によるものだとするなら……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "……もしかしたら、感染症みたいなものなのかな",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "ああ、いや、もしかしたらだけど……\n何か病原体的なやつがあって、それに感染したとか……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "localized_name": "スレイ",
    "romanized_name": "Slade",
    "model_path_hash": 1119361770767559406,
    "text": "感染した白きほうき星――赤のほうき星から\n病原体をうつされ、クルシュアは紅くなった……？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 5581277904703418049,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "うん……！　その可能性はありそう……\nそう仮定すれば、色々と辻褄が合うよ……！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "お、レスナのお墨付き！　病原体が原因ならさ、\nほうき星が通る空――星の海とかにありそうじゃない？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 8455227271865371244,
    "text": "よし来た！　早速調べてみましょ！\n星の海の調査は私に任せて！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6891392099494261238,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "localized_name": "リアス",
    "romanized_name": "Rias",
    "model_path_hash": 8538886338969864227,
    "text": "じゃああたしたちは、似たような話がないか、\n各地の伝承とか調べてみるよ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 1321279492992502345,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "アタシも案内人の伝手を使って聞き込んでくる！\nここぞとばかりに！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "みんな……ありがとう！！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "（私たちは、仮説を基に研究と調査を進めました）",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "（各地の伝承や文献に、\n　クルシュアと似た話がないか探したり――）",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "（かつて赤のほうき星が襲来したといわれる場所を\n　再度詳しく調査したり――）",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "（星の海の調査は、環境の変化に強い九偉人の皆さんが\n　主に担ってくださいました）",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "（たくさんの方の協力があり、私たちは――）",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "原因が分かりました。\n白きほうき星の変心は、外的要因によるものです",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "localized_name": "クリセルダ",
    "romanized_name": "Criselda",
    "model_path_hash": 2319149981238984606,
    "text": "星の海に漂う謎の物質――仮に微粒子αとしましょう。\nそれがほうき星に作用して、赤く変えさせていたんだわ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2415369427152481317,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "微粒子αは、取り込んだものの自我を喪失させ、\n凶暴化させる性質を持っているようで……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "localized_name": "リアス",
    "romanized_name": "Rias",
    "model_path_hash": 8538886338969864227,
    "text": "そうだったんだ……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 1321279492992502345,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "localized_name": "スレイ",
    "romanized_name": "Slade",
    "model_path_hash": 1119361770767559406,
    "text": "でも、原因が分かったなら、\nそれを赤のほうき星から取り除ければ――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 5581277904703418049,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "うん。赤のほうき星を、\n白きほうき星に戻せるかもしれません",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 3986021654722714881,
    "text": "いやー、まさかアルビちゃん空間の応用で\n星の海の調査ができるなんてね～",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4227931788932007159,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "アルビーナのおかげだよ、本当にありがとう！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 3986021654722714881,
    "text": "うん……お役に立てて、何よりっすわ！\n……へへっ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4227931788932007159,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "私はこれから、赤のほうき星を白きほうき星へ\n戻すための薬を調合したいと思っています",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "でも、初めてのことや分からないことだらけで、\nきっと私一人では長い長い時間が掛かってしまう……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "だから、どうかお願いです",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "白きほうき星を救うため、\n皆さんのお力を貸していただけないでしょうか！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 8455227271865371244,
    "text": "もう、今さらなに言ってんのよ。\n当たり前じゃない！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6891392099494261238,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "localized_name": "クリセルダ",
    "romanized_name": "Criselda",
    "model_path_hash": 2319149981238984606,
    "text": "今を生きる私たち人類の力で、錬金術の力で、\n白きほうき星を救ってあげましょう",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2415369427152481317,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 3101416597918110218,
    "text": "私は錬金術を使えないけど、\n私にできることで、精一杯手伝うわ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 5045460652135134961,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "皆さん……本当に、ありがとうございます！！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "――私たちがたどり着けなかったところまで、\nこんなにも早くたどり着いてしまうなんて",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 8455227271865371244,
    "text": "みんなと協力するレスナだから、たどり着けたのよ。\nいくらパルメ族が優れてても、限界はあるでしょ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6891392099494261238,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "localized_name": "アウグスト",
    "romanized_name": "August",
    "model_path_hash": 4783526781539751219,
    "text": "……そうだな。分かりやすい足し算だ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4550481465929894494,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "localized_name": "アウグスト",
    "romanized_name": "August",
    "model_path_hash": 4783526781539751219,
    "text": "パルメ族以外を上から「管理」しようとしていた\n我々だけでは届かなかっただろう",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4550481465929894494,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "……これがレスナの、今の人類の、「和の力」なのね",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "localized_name": "アウグスト",
    "romanized_name": "August",
    "model_path_hash": 4783526781539751219,
    "text": "今の人類、か……パルメの血もない、突出した天才でも\nないアルビーナが、ここまで研究に貢献してくるとはな",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4550481465929894494,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "ええ、本当に嬉しい誤算。あの子はこの星の人類だって\n異邦人にも負けない強さを持っていると示してくれた",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "localized_name": "アウグスト",
    "romanized_name": "August",
    "model_path_hash": 4783526781539751219,
    "text": "我々の「管理」が無くても、パルメ族のレスナが\n主導すれば、世界を託せると思っていたが……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4550481465929894494,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "localized_name": "アウグスト",
    "romanized_name": "August",
    "model_path_hash": 4783526781539751219,
    "text": "この期に及んでまだ皆を侮っていたようだ。\nすまない。我々はもう必要ないと心から納得した",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4550481465929894494,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "localized_name": "アウグスト",
    "romanized_name": "August",
    "model_path_hash": 4783526781539751219,
    "text": "レスナだけではない、お前たち人類の可能性を信じ、\n未来を託すとしよう",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4550481465929894494,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "そして薬を星の海に打ち上げて、\n彼方にいるほうき星へ届けるんです",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  }
]